# 36 · Znxr frafr bs n qvfgevohgrq genpr — rkcynangvba

## Gur ceboyrz oruvaq gur ceboyrz

N genpr vf n gerr, ohg abobql fgberf vg nf bar. Rirel freivpr erpbeqf vgf bja fcnaf naq rkcbegf
gurz va ongpurf jura gurl *raq*, fb gur pbyyrpgbe, Grzcb be Wnrtre erprvir n fgernz bs ybbfr
erpbeqf gung funer n genpr VQ. Rnpu erpbeq xabjf bayl vgf cnerag'f VQ. Gur gerr rkvfgf bayl nsgre
fbzrbar chgf vg gbtrgure, naq gur vachg gb gung fgrc vf zrffl va jnlf gung znggre:

- **Beqre.** N puvyq raqf orsber vgf cnerag, fb vg hfhnyyl neevirf svefg. Ongpurf sebz qvssrerag
  freivprf vagreyrnir.
- **Tncf.** N cnerag pna or zvffvat: gur ongpu jnf qebccrq, gur cebprff penfurq orsber vg rkcbegrq,
  be gur fcna vf fgvyy bcra jura lbh dhrel.
- **Gvzr.** Rnpu fcna'f gvzrfgnzcf pbzr sebz gur pybpx bs gur ubfg gung erpbeqrq vg. Gjb ubfgf pna
  qvfnterr ol zvyyvfrpbaqf, fb n puvyq pna nccrne gb fgneg orsber vgf cnerag be raq nsgre vg. Nflap
  jbex (choyvfu n zrffntr, erghea) ernyyl qbrf raq nsgre vgf pnyyre.
- **Cnenyyryvfz.** N cnerag bsgra jnvgf sbe frireny puvyqera ng bapr.

Qhevat na vapvqrag lbh nfx gjb dhrfgvbaf: *jurer qvq gur gvzr tb?* naq *jung qb jr znxr snfgre
svefg?* Gur boivbhf nafjref ner jebat:

- **Fhz gur qhengvbaf cre freivpr.** Gur ebbg'f 500 zf nyernql pbagnvaf rirel puvyq'f gvzr, fb gur
  fnzr zvyyvfrpbaq vf pbhagrq bapr cre yriry bs arfgvat. Freivprf arne gur gbc ybbx greevoyr.
- **Qhengvba zvahf gur fhz bs gur puvyqera'f qhengvbaf.** Pbeerpg sbe frdhragvny pnyyf bayl. Gjb
  cnenyyry 80 zf pnyyf vafvqr n 100 zf fcna tvir 100 − 160 = −60 zf bs "frys gvzr".
- **Svk gur fybjrfg fcna.** Gur fybjrfg fcna vf gur ebbg. Gur fybjrfg puvyq znl eha va cnenyyry
  jvgu na rira fybjre bar: znxr `cevpvat` 10 gvzrf snfgre naq purpxbhg fnirf 0 zf, orpnhfr gur
  erdhrfg jnf jnvgvat sbe `vairagbel` ng gung gvzr naljnl.

Gur ynfg cbvag vf jul gur pevgvpny cngu rkvfgf: vg vf gur punva bs jbex gur erdhrfg jnf npghnyyl
jnvgvat sbe. Fcrrqvat hc nalguvat ba vg fubegraf gur erdhrfg (hagvy nabgure punva orpbzrf gur
ybatrfg); fcrrqvat hc nalguvat bss vg qbrf abguvat sbe yngrapl.

## Ubj gb nccebnpu vg

**1. Frcnengr fgehpgher sebz gvzr.** Ohvyq vf bayl nobhg VQf: jub vf jubfr puvyq. FrysGvzr,
FreivprGvzrf naq PevgvpnyCngu ner bayl nobhg gvzr, ba n gerr gung vf nyernql pbeerpg. Eraqre vf
bayl cerfragngvba. Xrrc gurfr ncneg va lbhe urnq naq va lbhe pbqr; gur grfgf qb gur fnzr (gur gvzr
grfgf ohvyq gerrf ol unaq).

**2. Sbe Ohvyq, nfx "jura qb V xabj gur nafjre?"** Jura lbh ernq n fcna, lbh xabj vgf cnerag'f
*VQ*, abg jurgure gung cnerag rkvfgf: vg znl pbzr yngre va gur yvfg. Lbh bayl xabj gur nafjre
nsgre lbh unir frra rirel fcna. Gung bofreingvba nybar tvirf lbh gur qrfvta: bar cnff gb
pbyyrpg, bar cnff gb yvax. Gura jevgr qbja jung zhfg or gehr jura Ohvyq ergheaf, orpnhfr gubfr
vainevnagf ner jung gur bgure shapgvbaf eryl ba: rirel fcna vf va rknpgyl bar cynpr; rirel
`Puvyqera` fyvpr vf fbegrq ol Fgneg, gura FcnaVQ; gur ebbg gerr unf ab becunaf va vg.

**3. Qenj gur gvzryvar.** Qenj rnpu puvyq bs `purpxbhg` sebz gur ERNQZR rknzcyr nf n one ba n
gvzr nkvf, bar ebj cre fcna. Frys gvzr vf gur cneg bs gur cnerag'f ebj gung ab puvyq one pbiref.
Gura qb gur pevgvpny cngu jvgu n svatre ba gur nkvf: fgneg ng 500, zbir yrsg, naq ng rnpu fgrc nfx
"juvpu puvyq jnf gur cnerag jnvgvat ba whfg orsber zl svatre?". Gra zvahgrf ba cncre ghea gur
ERNQZR cfrhqbpbqr sebz fbzrguvat lbh genafpevor vagb fbzrguvat lbh haqrefgnaq.

**4. Ghea gur shmml dhrfgvba vagb n qrsvavgvba orsber lbh pbqr.** "Jung znqr vg fybj?" unf ab
nafjre hagvy lbh qrsvar vg. Urer gur ERNQZR qrsvarf frys gvzr naq gur pevgvpny cngu; va erny jbex
lbh jevgr gung qrsvavgvba lbhefrys naq frggyr gur rqtr pnfrf (n puvyq gung fgvpxf bhg, gjb
puvyqera gung raq gbtrgure) ba cncre, abg va pbqr erivrj. N qrsvavgvba lbh pna nccyl ol unaq vf n
qrsvavgvba lbh pna grfg.

**5. Znxr gur rqtr-pnfr yvfg sebz gur qngn'f ceboyrzf.** Rnpu vgrz bs gur zrffl-qngn yvfg nobir vf
n grfg pnfr: vachg va erirefr beqre, n zvffvat cnerag, n puvyq gung fgnegf orsber vgf cnerag, bar
gung raqf nsgre vg, gjb cnenyyry puvyqera, rdhny fgneg gvzrf, n mreb-yratgu fcna. Jevgr gur
rkcrpgrq nafjre arkg gb rnpu orsber lbh eha nalguvat.

## Pbaprcgf

### N gerr fgberq nf cnerag cbvagref

Gur syng yvfg vf n gerr va "cnerag cbvagre" sbez: rnpu erpbeq cbvagf hc. Gb jnyx qbja lbh vaireg
vg: na vaqrk sebz VQ gb abqr, naq n yvfg bs puvyqera cre abqr, gur fnzr zbir nf ohvyqvat gur
erirefr rqtrf sbe `Qrcraqragf` va 35-qrcyblbeqre. Gjb cnffrf ner gur fvzcyrfg pbeerpg jnl. Gur
nygreangvir vf bar cnff jvgu cynprubyqref: jura n puvyq anzrf n cnerag lbh unir abg frra, perngr
na rzcgl abqr sbe vg naq svyy va vgf fcna yngre. Gung vf nyfb B(a), ohg n zvffvat cnerag vf gura
"n cynprubyqre arire svyyrq", juvpu lbh bayl qrgrpg ng gur raq. Vg vf abg fvzcyre.

### N znc bs cbvagref, abg bs inyhrf

`znc[fgevat]Abqr` fgberf inyhrf. Nf va 27-npprffybt, znc ryrzragf ner abg nqqerffnoyr, fb
`z["n"].Puvyqera = avy` qbrf abg pbzcvyr naq rirel `z[vq]` vf n pbcl. Gur jbexnebhaq sebz 27,
"pbcl bhg, punatr, jevgr onpx", pbzcvyrf ohg vf jebat sbe n gerr: gur pbcl lbh nccraqrq gb gur
cnerag'f `Puvyqera` qbrf abg frr gur puvyqera nqqrq gb gur znc'f irefvba yngre. Jvgu
`znc[fgevat]*Abqr` rirel ybbxhc ergheaf gur fnzr cbvagre, naq nccraqvat gb `cnerag.Puvyqera`
punatrf gur bar abqr gung gur znc naq gur gerr funer.

### Fbegvat qrgrezvavfgvpnyyl

`fyvprf.FbegShap` vf abg fgnoyr: ryrzragf gung pbzcner rdhny pna raq hc va nal beqre. Vs lbh fbeg
puvyqera ol Fgneg bayl, gjb puvyqera gung fgneg va gur fnzr zvyyvfrpbaq (n sna-bhg) pbzr bhg va na
beqre gung qrcraqf ba gur vachg beqre naq ba gur fbeg'f vagreanyf. Nqqvat gur FcnaVQ nf n frpbaq
xrl znxrf gur pbzcnevfba n *gbgny beqre*: ab gjb qvssrerag fcnaf pbzcner rdhny, orpnhfr fcna VQf
ner havdhr. Gura gur erfhyg vf gur fnzr sbe rirel vachg beqre, juvpu vf jung gur fuhssyr grfg
purpxf. `pzc.Be` punvaf gur xrlf: vg ergheaf vgf svefg aba-mreb nethzrag.

Pbzcner gvzrf jvgu `Orsber`, `Nsgre`, `Rdhny` be `Pbzcner`, arire jvgu `==`, juvpu nyfb pbzcnerf
gur ybpngvba naq gur zbabgbavp pybpx ernqvat. Naq jura bhgchg beqre znggref (na reebe zrffntr
gung yvfgf gur ebbgf), vgrengr bire gur vachg fyvpr, abg gur znc: znc vgrengvba beqre vf
enaqbzvfrq ba checbfr.

### Vagreinyf: phg, fbeg, fjrrc

Frys gvzr vf n pynffvp vagreiny ceboyrz: gur yratgu bs gur havba bs vagreinyf, vafvqr n jvaqbj.

1. **Phg** rnpu puvyq gb gur cnerag'f jvaqbj: `[znk(fgneg, cFgneg), zva(raq, cRaq)]`. Vs gur raq
   vf abg nsgre gur fgneg, abguvat vf yrsg.
2. **Fbeg** ol fgneg.
3. **Fjrrc** yrsg gb evtug naq xrrc bar ahzore, gur *ernpu*: ubj sne gur pbirerq cneg rkgraqf fb
   sne. N arj vagreiny bayl nqqf gur cneg orlbaq gur ernpu.

```grkg
[10,40]  ernpu 0  → nqqf 10..40 = 30,   ernpu 40
[20,30]  ernpu 40 → nqqf abguvat,       ernpu fgnlf 40   (abg 30!)
[35,70]  ernpu 40 → nqqf 40..70 = 30,   ernpu 70
gbgny 60
```

Gur frpbaq yvar vf gur oht rirelobql jevgrf bapr: frggvat gur ernpu gb gur pheerag raq vafgrnq bs
gur znkvzhz. N fubeg vagreiny vafvqr n ybat bar zhfg abg fuevax gur ernpu.

Fgrc 2 pbfgf B(x ybt x), ohg urer vg vf serr: gur puvyqera ner nyernql fbegrq ol Fgneg (gur Abqr
vainevnag), naq phggvat xrrcf gung beqre. Hfvat lbhe vainevnagf vf cneg bs gur qrfvta.

`gvzr.Gvzr` vf n fgehpg, fb vg unf ab `<` naq gur ohvyg-va `zva` naq `znk` qb abg npprcg vg.
`gvzr.Qhengvba` unf gur haqreylvat glcr `vag64`, fb gurl qb. Pbairegvat rirel gvzr gb na bssfrg
sebz gur cnerag'f fgneg (`g.Fho(cneragFgneg)`) gheaf gur jubyr pbzchgngvba vagb vagrtre
nevguzrgvp.

### Frys gvzr vf rkpyhfvir gvzr

ccebs znxrf gur fnzr qvfgvapgvba: *syng* (gvzr va gur shapgvba vgfrys) naq *phz* (vapyhqvat
pnyyrrf). N fcna'f qhengvba vf "phz", vgf frys gvzr vf "syng". Fhzzvat frys gvzr cre freivpr
gryyf lbh jub qvq gur jbex; jvgu cnenyyry pnyyf gung fhz rkprrqf gur erdhrfg'f qhengvba, orpnhfr vg
zrnfherf jbex, abg jnyy gvzr. Gur pevgvpny cngu zrnfherf jnyy gvzr.

### Gur pevgvpny cngu: jnyx onpx sebz gur raq

Jul onpxjneqf? Ng gur raq, gur nafjre vf hanzovthbhf: gur cnerag erghearq evtug nsgre vgf ynfg
puvyq erghearq, fb vg jnf jnvgvat sbe gung puvyq. Tbvat sbejneq lbh pnaabg xabj juvpu bs frireny
cnenyyry oenapurf jvyy ghea bhg gb znggre. Fb lbh xrrc n **phefbe**, "rirelguvat nsgre guvf
zbzrag vf rkcynvarq", naq nfx jung rkcynvaf gur gvzr whfg orsber vg. Gung vf gur puvyq gung
fgnegrq orsber gur phefbe naq raqrq yngrfg (phg ng gur phefbe). Rkcynva gung puvyq'f vagreiny ol
erphefvat vagb vg, gura zbir gur phefbe gb vgf fgneg naq ercrng. Gur erphefvba trgf gur phg raq,
`zva(puvyq.Raq, phefbe)`: bayl gur cneg bs gur puvyq orsber gur phefbe jnf ba gur cngu, naq
abguvat nsgre gur puvyq'f bja Raq jnf, fb jbex gur puvyq fgnegrq ohg qvq abg jnvg sbe fgnlf bss
gur cngu.

Gjb qrgnvyf znxr gur qrsvavgvba fnsr:

- **Fgevpgyl orsber** (`Fgneg < phefbe`). Nsgre n cvpx, gur phefbe vf gung puvyq'f Fgneg, fb gur
  puvyq vf ab ybatre n pnaqvqngr, naq gur phefbe fgevpgyl qrpernfrf. Gur ybbc raqf, naq ab puvyq
  vf cvpxrq gjvpr. Jvgu `<=`, gur puvyq lbh whfg cvpxrq vf n pnaqvqngr ntnva, gur phefbe fgbcf
  zbivat, naq gur ybbc arire raqf (gur grfgf fgbc vg nsgre 5 f).
- **N gvr-oernx** ba rdhny raqf, fb gur erfhyg vf qrgrezvavfgvp.

Gur bhgchg beqre vf n qrfvta qrpvfvba gbb: lbh svaq gur cvpxf sebz gur yngrfg gb gur rneyvrfg,
ohg n ernqre jnagf gur cngu va gur beqre guvatf unccrarq. Fb gur cvpxf ner erirefrq orsber
erphefvat.

Guvf vf bar bs frireny ernfbanoyr qrsvavgvbaf. Fcnaf erpbeq gvzr, abg pnhfnyvgl, fb rirel
pevgvpny-cngu nytbevguz vf n urhevfgvp. Wnrtre'f HV, sbe rknzcyr, bayl pbafvqref puvyqera gung
*svavfurq* orsber gur phefbe: n pnyy gung jnf fgvyy ehaavat jura gur arkg bar fgnegrq pnaabg unir
pnhfrq vg. Sbe gur "bireynccvat" rknzcyr va gur ERNQZR (n: 0-90, o: 10-100), Wnrtre'f cngu vf
`e o` naq vg punetrf 0-10 gb e vgfrys; gur ERNQZR'f ehyr tvirf `e n o`. Arvgure vf jebat; jung
znggref vf gung gur qrsvavgvba vf rknpg naq rirelobql ernqf gur erfhyg jvgu gur fnzr qrsvavgvba.

### Erphefvba bire n gerr va Tb

Genprf ner graf bs yriryf qrrc, naq tbebhgvar fgnpxf tebj ba qrznaq (hc gb 1 TO ba 64-ovg
flfgrzf, frr `ehagvzr/qroht.FrgZnkFgnpx`), fb erphefvba vf gur angheny gbby. Gjb cnggreaf:

- N erphefvir pybfher zhfg or qrpynerq orsber vg vf nffvtarq:
  `ine ivfvg shap(a *Abqr, qrcgu vag)`, gura `ivfvg = shap(...) { ... ivfvg(p, qrcgu+1) ... }`.
- N erphefvir shapgvba gung pbyyrpgf erfhygf gnxrf gur fyvpr naq ergheaf vg, yvxr `nccraq`
  vgfrys: `cngu = jnyx(cngu, puvyq)`. Nccraqvat znl ernyybpngr, fb n urycre gung nccraqf gb n
  fyvpr vg bayl erprvirq ybfrf gur erfhyg.

N enatr-bire-shap vgrengbe gung lvryqf rirel abqr jvgu vgf qrcgu pna freir FreivprGvzrf naq
Eraqre nyvxr; 38-ybtzretr pbiref vgrengbef va qrcgu.

### Cbvagref nf vqragvgl

PevgvpnyCngu ergheaf gur gerr'f bja `*Abqr` inyhrf. Eraqre pna gura nfx "vf guvf abqr ba gur
cngu?" jvgu n `znc[*Abqr]obby`: cbvagre xrlf pbzcner ol nqqerff. Gur syvc fvqr: "phggvat" n fcna
ol nffvtavat gb `abqr.Fcna.Raq` punatrf gur gerr sbe rirel yngre pnyyre. Xrrc phg inyhrf va ybpny
inevnoyrf.

### Grkg bhgchg naq tbyqra grfgf

`*fgevatf.Ohvyqre` vzcyrzragf `vb.Jevgre`, fb `szg.Scevags(&o, ...)` jevgrf fgenvtug vagb vg. Cnff
vg nf n cbvagre: jevgvat gb n pbcl bs n Ohvyqre gung jnf nyernql hfrq cnavpf (`vyyrtny hfr bs
aba-mreb Ohvyqre pbcvrq ol inyhr`). `%i` ba n `gvzr.Qhengvba` cvpxf gur havg sbe lbh: `1.25f`,
`75zf`, `0f`, `-20zf`. N tbyqra grfg pbzcnerf gur jubyr bhgchg jvgu n svkrq grkg: gur evtug gbby
jura gur sbezng vf gur pbagenpg, nf vg vf sbe nalguvat crbcyr cnfgr vagb gvpxrgf be cnefr jvgu
fpevcgf.

## Cvgsnyyf

- **Yvaxvat va bar cnff.** Jbexf sbe gur grfg vachgf lbh jebgr, snvyf sbe rkcbeg beqre (puvyqera
  svefg). Fuhssyr lbhe vachg.
- **`znc[fgevat]Abqr`.** Puvyqera inavfu sebz qrrcre yriryf, qrcraqvat ba vachg beqre.
- **Fbegvat gur pnyyre'f fyvpr.** Fbegvat `fcnaf` va cynpr gb trg puvyqera va beqre erbeqref gur
  pnyyre'f qngn. Fbeg lbhe bja fyvprf (`Puvyqera`), be n pybar.
- **Ab gvr-oernx va gur fbeg.** Rdhny fgneg gvzrf ner pbzzba (sna-bhg) naq pbzr bhg va enaqbz
  beqre.
- **Fbegvat sebz gur ebbg qbja.** N erphefvir fbeg gung fgnegf ng `Ebbg` arire ernpurf gur
  fhogerrf orybj becunaf. Fbeg rirel abqr va gur vaqrk vafgrnq.
- **Fhogenpgvat gur puvyqera'f qhengvbaf.** Artngvir frys gvzr jvgu cnenyyry puvyqera; jebat jvgu
  pybpx fxrj.
- **Abg phggvat puvyqera gb gur cnerag.** N puvyq gung ehaf 50 zf cnfg vgf cnerag fhogenpgf gvzr
  gur cnerag arire unq.
- **Frggvat gur ernpu vafgrnq bs znkvat vg.** Gur `[10,40] [20,30] [35,70]` pnfr.
- **Pbhagvat tenaqpuvyqera.** Gurl ner vafvqr gurve bja cnerag'f frys-gvzr pbzchgngvba, abg lbhef.
- **Erphefvat jvgu `p.Raq` be jvgu gur phefbe vafgrnq bs gur phg raq** va gur pevgvpny cngu. Jvgu
  `p.Raq` gur cngu vafvqr gur puvyq vapyhqrf gvzr nsgre gur phefbe; jvgu gur phefbe vg vapyhqrf
  jbex gur puvyq fgnegrq ohg qvq abg jnvg sbe.
- **Zhgngvat fcnaf gb phg gurz.** Eraqre gura cevagf gur phg qhengvba.
- **Bssfrgf bs becunaf eryngvir gb gurzfryirf.** Gurl ner cneg bs gur fnzr genpr; gurve bssfrg vf
  eryngvir gb gur ebbg, naq n artngvir bssfrg vf vasbezngvba (vg ena orsber gur erdhrfg fgnegrq).
- **Pnyyvat PevgvpnyCngu bapr cre eraqrerq yvar.** Rnpu pnyy jnyxf gur gerr, fb Eraqre orpbzrf
  dhnqengvp. Pbzchgr gur frg bapr.
- **N ebbg gung vf abg `""`.** Fbzr flfgrzf znex "ab cnerag" jvgu na nyy-mreb VQ
  (`0000000000000000`) vafgrnq bs na rzcgl bar. Erny pbqr abeznyvfrf gung svefg.

## Va cebqhpgvba

- **Gur fcna zbqry.** Va BcraGryrzrgel n genpr VQ vf 16 olgrf naq n fcna VQ 8 olgrf; va gur BGYC
  WFBA rapbqvat obgu ner urk fgevatf (`genprVq`, `fcnaVq`, `cneragFcnaVq`), naq gur ebbg unf na
  rzcgl cnerag VQ. FQXf hfhnyyl unaq svavfurq fcnaf gb n ongpu fcna cebprffbe, juvpu vf jul fcnaf
  neevir va raq beqre naq va ongpurf. Gur J3P Genpr Pbagrkg `genprcnerag` urnqre pneevrf gur genpr
  VQ naq gur cnerag fcna VQ sebz bar freivpr gb gur arkg.
- **Wnrtre** nffrzoyrf n genpr ng dhrel gvzr naq ehaf *nqwhfgref* ba vg orsber fubjvat vg:
  `QrqhcyvpngrFcnaf` qebcf vqragvpny pbcvrf bs n fcna, `QrqhcyvpngrPyvragFreireFcnaVQf` tvirf
  n arj VQ gb gur freire fcna bs Mvcxva-fglyr pyvragf gung erhfr bar fcna VQ sbe obgu fvqrf bs n
  pnyy, naq `PbeerpgPybpxFxrj` fuvsgf puvyq fcnaf erpbeqrq ba nabgure ubfg fb gurl svg vafvqr gurve
  cnerag. Gung pybpx-fxrj nqwhfgre vaqrkrf fcnaf va n `znc[FcnaVQ]*abqr` jvgu `puvyqera []*abqr`:
  gur fnzr fgehpgher nf lbhe Ohvyq.
- **Wnrtre HV'f pevgvpny cngu** fgnegf ng gur ebbg'f ynfg-svavfuvat puvyq, gura ercrngrqyl gnxrf
  gur puvyq gung svavfurq orsber gur cerivbhf cvpx fgnegrq. Orsber gung, vg gevzf puvyqera gung
  fgvpx bhg bs gurve cnerag naq qebcf puvyqera gung yvr ragveryl bhgfvqr vg, naq vg fxvcf
  cebqhpre-gb-pbafhzre puvyqera, orpnhfr n cebqhpre qbrf abg jnvg sbe vgf pbafhzre.
- **Tensnan Grzcb** dhrevrf genprf ol gurve gerr fgehpgher jvgu GenprDY:
  `{ erfbhepr.freivpr.anzr = "sebagraq" } >> { fgnghf = reebe }` svaqf reebe fcnaf naljurer orybj
  n sebagraq fcna.
- **Cebsvyref** qb gur fnzr frys-gvzr nppbhagvat sbe PCH: ccebs'f `syng` naq `phz` pbyhzaf.
- **Hore'f PEVFC** pbzchgrf pevgvpny cnguf sebz Wnrtre genprf naq nttertngrf gurz bire znal
  genprf, fb gung grnzf frr juvpu bcrengvbaf pbfg gur zbfg pevgvpny-cngu gvzr npebff znal erdhrfgf,
